        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Classroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a  Classroom Function Lever (Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6300 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a> and PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300v\"><b>6300 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/passage-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-s-14-phl\"><b>Passage Function Lever for 6300 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-s-09-phl\"><b>Storeroom Function Lever for 6300 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPDQ Philadelphia style lever with round rose. Packaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-SH-08-PHL Keyed Classroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classroom Lever for Panic Device, PDQ 6-S-08-PHL",
                "description": "PDQ 6-S-08-PHL Classroom Function Lever (Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key)  is suitable for all Wide, or Medium  Stile Doors (aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door prep.",
